{"seq":1,"slug":"historiography","title":"史学理论","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography","introMarkdown":"# 史学理论 简介\n\n史学理论是历史研究的自我反思，追问历史学家如何认识过去、叙述过去以及历史知识的本质与限度。研究生阶段的史学理论学习要求超越具体历史事件的考察，进入对历史书写本身的批判性审视。\n\n本课程设置四个章节，系统覆盖史学理论的核心议题。第一章**史学理论基础**直面历史客观性问题、历史因果关系和历史分期问题三大根本性论争，帮助学习者建立对历史认识论的基本理解。第二章**史学流派**聚焦二十世纪最具影响力的三个史学取向——年鉴学派对长时段和社会经济结构的强调、微观史学对个体经验和日常生活的关注，以及全球史取向对跨区域联系和比较视野的追求，展示历史书写的多种可能路径。第三章**历史哲学**深入探讨叙事与历史的关系、记忆与历史的张力以及反事实历史的思维实验，考察历史书写的哲学根基。第四章**当代史学理论**关注后现代史学对传统史学实证主义的挑战、数字史学对史料处理和历史呈现方式的革新，以及公共历史将学术研究与社会需求相连接的实践探索。\n\n建议学习者在阅读理论文本的同时始终回到具体的史学作品中，观察理论如何塑造了历史书写的实际面貌。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"史学理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"historical-objectivity","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 历史客观性问题","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/foundations/historical-objectivity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"causation-in-history","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 历史因果关系","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/foundations/causation-in-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"periodization","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 历史分期问题","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/foundations/periodization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"schools","title":"史学流派","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/schools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"annales-school","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 年鉴学派","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/schools/annales-school"},{"seq":2,"slug":"microhistory","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 微观史学","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/schools/microhistory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-history-approach","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 全球史取向","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/schools/global-history-approach"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"philosophy-of-history","title":"历史哲学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/philosophy-of-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"narrative-and-history","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 叙事与历史","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/philosophy-of-history/narrative-and-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-and-history","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 记忆与历史","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/philosophy-of-history/memory-and-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"counterfactual-history","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 反事实历史","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/philosophy-of-history/counterfactual-history"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary","title":"当代史学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"postmodern-historiography","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 后现代史学","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/contemporary/postmodern-historiography"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-history","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 数字史学","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/contemporary/digital-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-history","title":"研究生 史学理论 — 公共历史","url":"/education/graduate/history/historiography/contemporary/public-history"}]}]}